{"route":"/docs/6.0/layout/containers/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Containers","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Containers are a fundamental building block of Bootstrap that contain, pad, and align your content within a given device or viewport."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-they-work","type":"heading","en":"How they work","level":2},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Containers are the most basic layout element in Bootstrap and are <strong>required when using our default grid system</strong>. Containers are used to contain, pad, and (sometimes) center the content within them. While containers <em>can</em> be nested, most layouts do not require a nested container."},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap comes with three different containers:"},{"id":"how-they-work--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.container</code>, which sets a <code>max-width</code> at each responsive breakpoint"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.{breakpoint}:container</code>, which is <code>width: 100%</code> until the specified breakpoint"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.container-fluid</code>, which is <code>width: 100%</code> at all breakpoints"}]}]},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"The table below illustrates how each container’s <code>max-width</code> compares to the original <code>.container</code> and <code>.container-fluid</code> across each breakpoint."},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"See them in action and compare them in our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/examples/grid/#containers\">Grid example</a>."},{"id":"how-they-work--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Extra small"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"&lt;576px"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Small"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"≥576px"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"Medium"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"≥768px"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"Large"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"≥1024px"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"X-Large"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"≥1280px"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"2X-Large"},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"≥1536px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"540px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"720px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"960px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-22","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-23","type":"paragraph","en":"1440px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-24","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.sm:container</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-25","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-26","type":"paragraph","en"